{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/8daeb2b90bf613740fcf70ed722b4703.poster.avif?t=1766599333\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/8daeb2b90bf613740fcf70ed722b4703.webm?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hadarot is a tactical deck-building roguelike focused on constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-stop combat on a single battlefield, where enemies return again and again, each time more lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time marches on, threats accumulate, and every decision counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pace of play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn increases the power of the cards you can play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the riskier and more powerful your decisions become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you reach the limit, the boss appears.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Permanent Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't play cards that <strong>attack</strong> and <strong>disappear</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <u><strong>deploy</strong></u> <strong>troops</strong>, <strong>towers</strong>, and <strong>units</strong> with their <strong>own health and damage</strong> that remain on the field fighting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/4e9ea7f39bb57ab985d50bbde52424ad.poster.avif?t=1766599333\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/4e9ea7f39bb57ab985d50bbde52424ad.webm?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy and Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends not only on what cards you have, but how and when you use them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell cards to adapt your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your coins, linked to the pace of combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your strategy according to the enemies approaching</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Types of cards </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game you will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Troops</strong> that fight turn after turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent <strong>passives</strong> that change your game forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions</strong> and <strong>aids</strong> for critical moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towers</strong> that automatically attack new enemies </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/40debfd5b8aa98744b25c1ce4d4835b9.poster.avif?t=1766599333\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/40debfd5b8aa98744b25c1ce4d4835b9.webm?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/40debfd5b8aa98744b25c1ce4d4835b9.mp4?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your decisions also determine who you will face in the end.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Save the angels and challenge <strong>God</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Embrace chaos and face <strong>Satan</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take no side and face <strong>Justice</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each path changes enemies, shops, and challenges.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Golden Beetroot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/a3113d661e3cf68de7264fcf094fc448bbc4d654.jpg"},{"name":"Xx_GodKiller_77_xX","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/3d576095b3450f61c19f176af0925cfffcc11f1e.jpg"},{"name":"Ending all evils.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/8147d8addd24e76c0f362d956acc558f24d3d98b.jpg"},{"name":"Imposing your own justice.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/33386afd59b52cf78f2b203724e713eda8b67b82.jpg"},{"name":"Worse than Judas Iscariot.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/0236c6ac7a6901f6d82938b9b4e01f9ff14f21d1.jpg"},{"name":"The God of Lightning ran out of light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/0c690d2367832ce392375be1a548f4535a9783ac.jpg"},{"name":"Swallowed and digested.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/34aee6d486badd72bac5fe46dd1df0d61ff5f160.jpg"},{"name":"First lessons.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/ac5515ae9b5e259c84fc4d2c70f90da7799afb47.jpg"},{"name":"Won at her own game.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/c4651dec9b63065026ab39371f13149db4a0d124.jpg"},{"name":"Fond of death.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2880080/a5ce5ee6380fe6586a70450706f1ff78251946c7.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2880080?t=1766599333","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2880080?t=1766599333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/740cff2cf2d8f096362d60bd122072ddf91976b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766599333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/740cff2cf2d8f096362d60bd122072ddf91976b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766599333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2916550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/8daeb2b90bf613740fcf70ed722b4703.poster.avif?t=1766599333\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/8daeb2b90bf613740fcf70ed722b4703.webm?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hadarot is a tactical deck-building roguelike focused on constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-stop combat on a single battlefield, where enemies return again and again, each time more lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time marches on, threats accumulate, and every decision counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pace of play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn increases the power of the cards you can play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the riskier and more powerful your decisions become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you reach the limit, the boss appears.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Permanent Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't play cards that <strong>attack</strong> and <strong>disappear</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <u><strong>deploy</strong></u> <strong>troops</strong>, <strong>towers</strong>, and <strong>units</strong> with their <strong>own health and damage</strong> that remain on the field fighting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/4e9ea7f39bb57ab985d50bbde52424ad.poster.avif?t=1766599333\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/4e9ea7f39bb57ab985d50bbde52424ad.webm?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy and Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends not only on what cards you have, but how and when you use them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell cards to adapt your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your coins, linked to the pace of combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust your strategy according to the enemies approaching</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Types of cards </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game you will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Troops</strong> that fight turn after turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent <strong>passives</strong> that change your game forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions</strong> and <strong>aids</strong> for critical moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towers</strong> that automatically attack new enemies </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/40debfd5b8aa98744b25c1ce4d4835b9.poster.avif?t=1766599333\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/40debfd5b8aa98744b25c1ce4d4835b9.webm?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/extras/40debfd5b8aa98744b25c1ce4d4835b9.mp4?t=1766599333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your decisions also determine who you will face in the end.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Save the angels and challenge <strong>God</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Embrace chaos and face <strong>Satan</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take no side and face <strong>Justice</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each path changes enemies, shops, and challenges.</i></p>","developers":["Abel Mart\u00edn"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880080/05d3e737037846adb4eb922185cece02a2471193/header.jpg?t=1766599333","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1Gb Video Memory, capable of OpenGL 3.0+ support (2.1 with ARB extensions acceptable)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14+<br></